                                <span>Inulin (4g)</span>
                                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                            </button>
                            <div x-show="open === 'inulin-gut'" x-collapse x-cloak>
                                <div class="ingredient-detail mt-2">
                                    <p class="text-warm-gray mb-4">Prebiotic fiber that supports growth of healthy gut bacteria (Bifidobacteria). Strengthens gut lining, increases calcium uptake, and reduces LDL cholesterol and triglycerides.</p>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-warm-gray">Also enhances magnesium absorption &mdash; working together with the magnesium in your morning blend.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <button class="ingredient-tag w-full justify-between" @click="open = open === 'taurine-heart' ? null : 'taurine-heart'" :aria-expanded="open === 'taurine-heart'">
                                <span>Taurine (3.05g)</span>
                                <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                            </button>
                            <div x-show="open === 'taurine-heart'" x-collapse x-cloak>
                                <div class="ingredient-detail mt-2">
