                            </button>
                            <div x-show="open === 'lutein-brain'" x-collapse x-cloak>
                                <div class="ingredient-detail mt-2">
                                    <p class="text-warm-gray mb-4">Accumulate in the macula of your eye to filter blue light and protect against age-related vision decline. Lutein also concentrates in the hippocampus &mdash; supporting memory and learning.</p>
                                    <p class="text-sm text-warm-gray">Most adults only get 1-2mg/day. Coastline delivers the clinical dose from the AREDS2 study.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

